# CI coverage gate (blocks Play / RuStore)

CI runs **`./gradlew check`**. The job fails if **line coverage** is below **`MIN_COVERAGE`** (default **80%**, set in Gradle JaCoCo config and `.github/workflows/ci.yml` once skeleton exists).

**Deploy Play / RuStore** runs only after **green CI** on `main`.

## Before push to `main`

```bash
./gradlew check
```

Confirm JaCoCo reports coverage ≥ 80% and all unit tests pass.

## When adding features

- Follow TDD (`.cursor/rules/tdd-first.mdc`).
- If coverage drops near the gate, add focused unit tests (parsers, ViewModels, repositories) — not screenshot churn.
- Do not lower `MIN_COVERAGE` without an explicit owner decision.

